 #uuid "727440ce-9bc9-544c-889f-00c2107d4977" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186193814 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424058 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{19}{9}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424058 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424058 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "30c9587e-71e5-566c-a7c0-2ca7d8543d06" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424060 #edb/ref 1080 "2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424060 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424060 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "44d46d21-8790-5b62-b822-b15cfffb758c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424061 #edb/ref 1080 "15" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424061 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424061 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "493212b2-48a2-5243-a9c9-38c8ad4f746e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424062 #edb/ref 1080 "12" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424062 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424062 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "58440bd6-5f91-58ba-8252-d7a100bf2bbc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424063 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{20}{3}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424063 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424063 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "6ddc91ad-5eb5-580c-aec8-05f1a65ef396" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424064 #edb/ref 1080 "13" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424064 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424064 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "73b5e0f3-2a9f-5fb2-98c7-0b0e8e8b99a2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424065 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{37}{18}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424065 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424065 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "77b11337-68cc-5792-80b0-2420a4a46582" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424070 #edb/ref 1080 "18" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424070 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424070 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "955a942b-f31a-5981-97c6-1e16d11283d8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424078 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{8}{9}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424078 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424078 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "f27e69cb-8e5b-5f27-b7bd-fd886daab64b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424079 #edb/ref 1080 "10" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424079 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424079 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "fd63a7fa-8fda-54c4-8de2-4fa95151be2c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424080 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424058 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424080 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424060 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424080 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424063 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424080 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424065 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424080 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424078 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424080 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424080 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424080 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186424065 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424080 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "174c2ec8-e1f1-51fa-bb13-18381c6477ca" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424083 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424061 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424083 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424062 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424083 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424064 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424083 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424070 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424083 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186424079 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424083 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424083 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424083 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186424061 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424083 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "807b5737-467e-51a3-be92-0cedb472eebd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424086 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186424080 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424086 #edb/ref 1069 "q-90386" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424086 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424086 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that $X$ is a continuous random variable with the following probability density function, compute $\\text{E}[X].$\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{x}{12}+\\frac{1}{3},\\,1\\le x\\le 3\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424086 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "3754a443-839d-5055-afd8-172b5271b8be" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424086 #edb/ref 1074 "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ we can calculate the expected value using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]={\\int }_{S}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\n \n\nWe compute the expected value of $X$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}x\\cdot (\\frac{x}{12}+\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{12}+\\frac{x}{3})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={(\\frac{{x}^{3}}{36}+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6})|}_{1}^{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{37}{18}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424089 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186424083 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424089 #edb/ref 1069 "q-90455" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424089 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424089 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that $X$ is a continuous random variable with the following probability density function, compute $\\text{E}[8X-3].$\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{9},\\,0<x<3\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424089 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "a6256bcf-ce6c-599c-ab9b-d80ffcce67e9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424089 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we simplify using the properties of expected value:\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[8X-3]=8\\text{E}[X]-3\n$$\n\nFor a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ we can calculate the expected value using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]={\\int }_{S}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, we calculate the expected value of $X$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & ={\\int }_{S}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}x\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{2}}{9}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}\\frac{{x}^{3}}{9}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\frac{{x}^{4}}{36}|}_{0}^{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[8X-3] & =8\\text{E}[X]-3 \\\\  & =8\\cdot \\frac{9}{4}-3 \\\\  & =15.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
